      "key": [
        "Nefer",
        "Man Who Became a Mule",
        "desert stories"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Sarin"
      ],
      "comment": "Sarin: Nefer's commissions",
      "content": "Nefer has struck up a long-term partnership with the Guild. Adventurers bring her stories passed down among the desert people, she pays them and sometimes does favours. Sarin agreed to her terms and handled the commission for \"The Man Who Became a Mule\", found with a Snezhnayan collector. The story was the last one her father told and the only one whose ending he left unaltered.",
