      "key": [
        "Clink Clank Clash",
        "self-defence device",
        "Krum-Clank"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Sarin"
      ],
      "comment": "Sarin: Clink Clank Clash and the self-defence device",
      "content": "During the limited-time Clink Clank Clash event, Sarin explained that adventurers in Nod-Krai lack local authority protection, so he designed a self-defence device for them, but it used outside technology that did not suit Nod-Krai's kuuvahki. He commissioned Aino to improve it. Later he joined Ineffa, Ginette, Sedile and others in the battle at the Krumkake Craftshop.",
