      ],
      "comment": "Sarin: Great Expeditionist Challenge",
      "content": "In the limited-time 7.0 tournament at the Guild's Snezhnaya headquarters, branch masters and star adventurers compete. Sarin is a competitor representing Nod-Krai; he tells the Traveler how Lan earned the title \"Swordseeker of Qingxu\" and hopes to ask her to consult for his branch.",
